$()
$()
!exit

:help
$()
$()
!exit

:solution
$()
$()
!exit

:latex
$()
$()
!exit

:feedback
!ifval 0==0
 <div class='oef_feedbacks'><b>Solution.</b> <br/>	The normal form of 
!insmath f'(x)
$() is 
!insmath $val19
$(). <br/>	The factorized form of 
!insmath f'(x)
$() is 
!insmath $val18
$().
$()</div>
!endif

!exit

:test

!exit

:stat
